and `getContent()` equal to the two-open seed.\n(d) [M4] is the Proof's own `Run:` line (`bun test tests/state-exams/type-due-date.test.ts`). It is not encoded in this file: an exam proves its own claim and never runs another exam, so that leg is graded by the run the driver makes of it.\n\nEvery fixture read and every render happens inside a test body (the state linter's capture child imports this file with `stateExam` and `bun:test` stubbed). Expected red at BASE for one reason: no tags box on the tree.","created_at":"2026-09-17T04:51:36.572087350Z"},"created_at":"2026-09-17T04:51:36.575Z"}
